  Android's `ACTION_DIAL` only opens the dialler. `menu_driver` is SCR-DI-036's card label, which the
  Android drawer takes from `app_name`.

  NOT HERE. `home_daily_fee_*` carries no `Rs` of its own and `L3` is not a string at all — both are
  data, not copy (`MoneyFormat.prefix`, `DashboardLabels.level`). SCR-DI-035's buffered-samples card
  is C093's on this platform and its copy comes with it.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

